      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "## handlePresentation\n\nThe art the port wears: a small graph whose view holds SVG, HTML or canvas, drawn whole with its centre on the border. Changes how the port looks, never how it behaves.\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| Scope | handle, applies to port, any |\n| Written at | `node.data.handlePresentation` |\n| Type | reference |\n| Default | none |\n| Valid | \"address\", or { sourceRef, sourceNodeId, sourcePayload } |\n| Applies | edit, browse |\n| Properties panel | no |\n| Written down | AGENTS.md |\n| Status | built |"
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "authoring-contract-switches"
        },
        "switch": {
          "id": "handle-presentation",
          "name": "handlePresentation",
          "scope": "handle",
          "writePath": "node.data.handlePresentation",
          "valueType": "reference",
          "default": null,
          "shape": "\"address\", or { sourceRef, sourceNodeId, sourcePayload }",
          "effect": "The art the port wears: a small graph whose view holds SVG, HTML or canvas, drawn whole with its centre on the border. Changes how the port looks, never how it behaves.",
          "modes": [
            "edit",
            "browse"
          ],
          "panel": "no",
          "writtenDown": "AGENTS.md",
          "status": "built",
          "appliesTo": [
            "port",
            "any"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
