          "value": "## view.scroll\n\nThe view is one page that scrolls, like the page behind a focused graph; a tile or a portal shows its scrollbar, and the wheel scrolls it only there.\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| Scope | node, applies to face |\n| Written at | `node.data.view.scroll` |\n| Type | enum |\n| Default | none |\n| Valid | page |\n| Applies | browse |\n| Properties panel | no |\n| Written down | no |\n| Status | built |"
