      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "## membrane.bounds\n\nCrops the graph's window by hand and turns the automatic box off. Set by dragging the corner of the focused graph. Do not use it to fix clipping: move the hidden nodes inside the box instead.\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| Scope | graph, applies to root |\n| Written at | `root.data.membrane.bounds` |\n| Type | rectangle |\n| Default | none |\n| Valid | { x, y, width, height } |\n| Applies | edit, browse |\n| Properties panel | corner drag |\n| Written down | AGENTS.md |\n| Status | built |"
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "authoring-contract-switches"
        },
        "switch": {
          "id": "membrane-bounds",
          "name": "membrane.bounds",
          "scope": "graph",
          "writePath": "root.data.membrane.bounds",
          "valueType": "rectangle",
          "shape": "{ x, y, width, height }",
          "default": null,
          "effect": "Crops the graph's window by hand and turns the automatic box off. Set by dragging the corner of the focused graph. Do not use it to fix clipping: move the hidden nodes inside the box instead.",
          "modes": [
            "edit",
            "browse"
          ],
          "panel": "corner drag",
          "writtenDown": "AGENTS.md",
          "status": "built",
          "appliesTo": [
            "root"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "authoring-contract-switches-switch-render-shape",
      "type": "content",
