      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "## style.route\n\nThe path the line takes between its ends. orthogonal turns at right angles; curved bends.\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| Scope | edge, applies to any |\n| Written at | `edge.style.route` |\n| Type | enum |\n| Default | straight |\n| Valid | straight, curved, orthogonal; also read: direct as straight |\n| Applies | edit, browse |\n| Properties panel | yes (\"Route style\") |\n| Written down | edgeStyleContract.js |\n| Status | built |\n| Governed by | policy-edge-class |"
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "authoring-contract-switches"
        },
        "switch": {
          "id": "edge-route",
          "name": "style.route",
          "scope": "edge",
          "writePath": "edge.style.route",
          "valueType": "enum",
          "default": "straight",
          "effect": "The path the line takes between its ends. orthogonal turns at right angles; curved bends.",
          "modes": [
            "edit",
            "browse"
          ],
          "panel": "yes (\"Route style\")",
          "writtenDown": "edgeStyleContract.js",
          "status": "built",
          "governedBy": "policy-edge-class",
          "enum": [
            "straight",
            "curved",
            "orthogonal"
          ],
          "aliases": {
