        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "## settings.edgeAvoidNodes\n\nWhether a curved edge bends around the nodes in its way. Off, a curve is a plain curve that may pass behind them. Rounded right-angle routes are the orthogonal route, not this.\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| Scope | graph, applies to root |\n| Written at | `root.data.settings.edgeAvoidNodes` |\n| Type | boolean |\n| Default | true |\n| Valid | true, false |\n| Applies | edit, browse |\n| Properties panel | yes (Document Properties, \"Curved edges avoid nodes\") |\n| Written down | no |\n| Status | built |"
